# Governs the build context for services built from repo root
# (eval-runner/Dockerfile, livekit/Dockerfile). dashboard/ has its own
# .dockerignore since it builds from ./dashboard as context instead.

# Dependencies / build artifacts (rebuilt fresh inside each image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/venv

# Secrets — never send these into a build context
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example

# VCS / IDE / OS
.git
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Large, irrelevant to any service's runtime
docs/
reference/
knowledge-base/

# Misc
*.log
*.pid
